--------------------------------
maximum_kernel_cuda
来源: aten/src/ATen/native/cuda/MaxMinElementwiseKernel.cu
--------------------------------

【签名】
    @host→device
    maximum_kernel_cuda(iter: TensorIteratorBase)

【算法】
    match iter.dtype():
        ScalarType::Bool:
            opmath_symmetric_gpu_kernel_with_scalars<bool>(
                iter, λ(a, b) -> a || b
            )
        
        IntegralTypes (int8, int16, int32, int64, uint8):
            opmath_symmetric_gpu_kernel_with_scalars<scalar_t>(
                iter, λ(a, b) -> ::max(a, b)
            )
        
        FloatingTypes (float, double, half, bfloat16):
            opmath_symmetric_gpu_kernel_with_scalars<scalar_t>(
                iter, λ(a, b) -> 
                    if a != a: return a      # a是NaN
                    elif b != b: return b    # b是NaN
                    else: return ::max(a, b)
            )

【备注】
    - NaN传播: 浮点类型优先返回NaN值
    - Bool类型: maximum等价于逻辑OR

--------------------------------
minimum_kernel_cuda
来源: aten/src/ATen/native/cuda/MaxMinElementwiseKernel.cu
--------------------------------

【签名】
    @host→device
    minimum_kernel_cuda(iter: TensorIteratorBase)

【算法】
    match iter.dtype():
        ScalarType::Bool:
            opmath_symmetric_gpu_kernel_with_scalars<bool>(
                iter, λ(a, b) -> a && b
            )
        
        IntegralTypes (int8, int16, int32, int64, uint8):
            opmath_symmetric_gpu_kernel_with_scalars<scalar_t>(
                iter, λ(a, b) -> ::min(a, b)
            )
        
        FloatingTypes (float, double, half, bfloat16):
            opmath_symmetric_gpu_kernel_with_scalars<scalar_t>(
                iter, λ(a, b) -> 
                    if a != a: return a      # a是NaN
                    elif b != b: return b    # b是NaN
                    else: return ::min(a, b)
            )

【备注】
    - NaN传播: 浮点类型优先返回NaN值
    - Bool类型: minimum等价于逻辑AND

--------------------------------
fmax_kernel_cuda
来源: aten/src/ATen/native/cuda/MaxMinElementwiseKernel.cu
--------------------------------

【签名】
    @host→device
    fmax_kernel_cuda(iter: TensorIteratorBase)

【算法】
    if isFloatingType(iter.common_dtype()):
        opmath_symmetric_gpu_kernel_with_scalars<scalar_t>(
            iter, λ(a, b) -> ::fmax(a, b)
        )
    else:
        maximum_kernel_cuda(iter)

【备注】
    - ::fmax: C标准库函数，NaN处理不同于::max (返回非NaN值)
    - 非浮点类型回退到maximum_kernel_cuda

--------------------------------
